508
00:46:18,111 --> 00:46:20,780
Get the girls!

509
00:46:21,031 --> 00:46:22,824
Okay, asshole!

510
00:46:23,074 --> 00:46:24,826
Move! Come on! Get out!

511
00:46:25,076 --> 00:46:27,912
Fast! Move!

512
00:46:28,163 --> 00:46:31,082
Get your hands on that tree
and face each other!

513
00:46:31,332 --> 00:46:32,834
Hands in front of you!

514
00:46:33,084 --> 00:46:37,088
- My leg...
- Don't move it, or I'll break your arm.

515
00:46:37,339 --> 00:46:39,758
Got them!

516
00:46:41,468 --> 00:46:43,136
Show me your hands!

517
00:46:43,386 --> 00:46:45,221
Right now!

518
00:46:45,472 --> 00:46:48,850
Put your hands out there!

519
00:46:52,228 --> 00:46:53,521
See how easy that was?

520
00:46:53,772 --> 00:46:57,359
Boom! Still alive.
Now we question him. You know why?

521
00:46:57,609 --> 00:47:00,862
Because I didn't shoot him
or jump off a building with him.

522
00:47:01,112 --> 00:47:02,530
The building guy lived.

523
00:47:02,781 --> 00:47:04,532
The point being, no killing.

524
00:47:04,783 --> 00:47:06,826
- No killing, right.
- Right.

525
00:47:07,077 --> 00:47:09,120
Piece of cake. Now I'm happy.

526
00:47:09,371 --> 00:47:13,583
Read him his rights.
I'll stand here being happy.

527
00:47:14,584 --> 00:47:17,212
He's got a gun!

528
00:47:59,462 --> 00:48:03,633
You ever met anybody you didn't kill?

529
