Well, I haven't killed you yet.

530
00:48:09,973 --> 00:48:11,725
Don't do me no favors.

531
00:48:11,975 --> 00:48:15,061
Don't you worry.

532
00:48:25,488 --> 00:48:30,744
The coroner gave the body
a ride downtown.

533
00:48:31,286 --> 00:48:34,831
I guess we can get out of here.

534
00:48:38,335 --> 00:48:42,339
I'm sorry about that shit
I said out there.

535
00:48:42,797 --> 00:48:47,010
You saved my life. Thank you.

536
00:48:51,806 --> 00:48:54,809
I bet that hurt to say.

537
00:48:55,810 --> 00:48:58,605
You'll never know.

538
00:48:59,147 --> 00:49:00,607
Let's get a bite to eat.

539
00:49:00,857 --> 00:49:03,735
Get my shoes on.

540
00:49:13,161 --> 00:49:17,457
- Mom, Rog is coming.
- Okay, Carrie.

541
00:49:25,048 --> 00:49:29,052
Here's my welcoming committee!
Where's my daughter? Which one...?

542
00:49:29,302 --> 00:49:33,306
- Come on, Daddy.
- This one's my daughter!

543
00:49:33,556 --> 00:49:36,267
