544
00:49:36,518 --> 00:49:37,936
How are you doing?

545
00:49:38,186 --> 00:49:39,771
I am doing all right.

546
00:49:40,021 --> 00:49:41,940
Is that a crook?

547
00:49:42,190 --> 00:49:46,277
No, this is my new partner, Martin.

548
00:49:48,613 --> 00:49:50,907
I'm glad you're home
at a sensible hour.

549
00:49:51,157 --> 00:49:53,993
Well, I try to be a sensible dad.

550
00:49:54,244 --> 00:49:56,454
Come on in, Martin.

551
00:49:56,705 --> 00:49:59,040
Yeah, close the door.

552
00:49:59,290 --> 00:50:04,796
Hello, Nick. Get your legs
off the arm of the couch.

553
00:50:05,005 --> 00:50:10,468
How you doing? Is Mommy
in the kitchen? Let's sneak up on her.

554
00:50:14,180 --> 00:50:17,142
Hello, baby!
I want you to meet...

555
00:50:17,392 --> 00:50:20,186
I'd like you to meet
Daddy's new partner.

556
00:50:20,437 --> 00:50:22,022
- Martin Riggs.
- How are you?

557
00:50:22,272 --> 00:50:25,275
