627
00:54:29,978 --> 00:54:32,313
Mark asked me to a club
tomorrow night.

628
00:54:32,564 --> 00:54:35,608
- You're grounded. You know that.
- Please, Daddy?

629
00:54:35,859 --> 00:54:36,985
Which one is Mark?

630
00:54:37,235 --> 00:54:39,904
- The blond one.
- With pits in his face?

631
00:54:40,155 --> 00:54:41,489
Those are dimples.

632
00:54:41,740 --> 00:54:46,077
Pits. When he smiles, I can see
through his head. The answer is no.

633
00:54:46,327 --> 00:54:47,495
Have a heart, Rog.

634
00:54:47,746 --> 00:54:51,249
Hey, buddy. She smoked pot
