635
00:54:51,499 --> 00:54:55,211
Why can I have a beer
and I can't smoke a joint?

636
00:54:55,462 --> 00:54:56,713
It's not coke, you know.

637
00:54:56,963 --> 00:55:00,925
I'll tell you why.
Because now, at this moment...

638
00:55:01,176 --> 00:55:04,512
...beer is legal, grass ain't.
Right or wrong?

639
00:55:04,763 --> 00:55:05,722
It's wrong.

640
00:55:05,972 --> 00:55:08,350
Right.

641
00:55:12,937 --> 00:55:17,192
They sit there drinking six-packs
and I get grounded.

642
00:55:17,317 --> 00:55:19,444
I'm gonna go home.

643
00:55:19,694 --> 00:55:22,072
Did we resolve anything here tonight?

644
00:55:22,322 --> 00:55:25,158
Yeah, we resolved plenty.

645
00:55:25,408 --> 00:55:27,911
We know your wife
takes out the garbage...

646
00:55:28,161 --> 00:55:31,956
...your daughter smokes grass
and it's illegal...

647
00:55:32,207 --> 00:55:36,586
...and you don't know
a lot about boats.

648
00:55:39,422 --> 00:55:41,841
You got a hell of a nice family there.

649
00:55:42,092 --> 00:55:43,760
Thank you.

650
00:55:44,010 --> 00:55:46,012
I enjoyed the meal. Thanks a lot.

651
00:55:46,262 --> 00:55:51,101
Bullshit. But thanks anyway.

652
00:55:55,855 --> 00:55:58,858
You don't trust me at all, do you?

653
00:55:59,109 --> 00:56:03,863
I tell you what. You make it through
tomorrow without killing anybody...

654
00:56:04,114 --> 00:56:09,619
...especially me or yourself,
then I'll start trusting you.

655
00:56:10,370 --> 00:56:13,289
Fair enough.

656
00:56:16,876 --> 00:56:18,753
I do it real good, you know.

657
00:56:19,004 --> 00:56:21,423
Do what?

658
00:56:23,216 --> 00:56:27,637
When I was 19, I did a guy
in Laos from 1000 yards out.

659
00:56:27,887 --> 00:56:31,641
A rifle shot in high wind.

660
00:56:32,559 --> 00:56:34,352
Maybe eight...

661
00:56:34,602 --> 00:56:39,315
...or even 10 guys in the world
could have made that shot.

662
00:56:42,318 --> 00:56:46,448
It's the only thing I was ever good at.

663
00:56:47,490 --> 00:56:50,160
See you tomorrow.

664
00:56:50,535 --> 00:56:53,747
Yeah, see you.

665
00:56:59,127 --> 00:57:02,714
You really like my wife's cooking?

666
00:57:07,761 --> 00:57:09,679
No.

667
00:57:09,929 --> 00:57:12,724
See you tomorrow.

668
00:57:57,143 --> 00:57:59,396
- You looking for something?
- Aren't we all?

669
00:57:59,646 --> 00:58:04,859
