What'd you have in mind?

675
00:58:26,548 --> 00:58:30,468
I want you to come home
and watch television with me.

676
00:58:30,719 --> 00:58:35,557
- That's all?
- Yeah, "Three Stooges" are coming on.

677
00:58:35,807 --> 00:58:40,937
