the night she died.

693
01:01:47,457 --> 01:01:49,709
Until now, we assumed it was a man.

694
01:01:49,959 --> 01:01:51,628
Suppose it was Dixie.

695
01:01:51,878 --> 01:01:56,049
Disgusting, but okay. Let's say Dixie
put the drain cleaner in her pills.

696
01:01:56,299 --> 01:01:57,759
Say someone paid her.

697
01:01:58,009 --> 01:02:03,098
She thinks, "Amanda swallows a couple
downers and she's dead." Then Dixie...

698
01:02:03,348 --> 01:02:04,349
If it was her.

699
01:02:04,599 --> 01:02:09,688
If it was her. She's got time
to spritz the place up and get out.

700
01:02:09,938 --> 01:02:12,065
But Amanda jumps out the window.

701
01:02:12,315 --> 01:02:14,150
Or Dixie pushes her.

702
01:02:14,401 --> 01:02:17,320
She has to make a quick exit
