That's pretty fucking thin.

711
01:02:44,681 --> 01:02:46,016
That's very thin.

712
01:02:46,266 --> 01:02:47,934
Thin's my middle name.

713
01:02:48,184 --> 01:02:51,771
Your wife's cooking, I'm not surprised.

714
01:02:52,022 --> 01:02:53,690
- What?
- Nothing.

715
01:02:53,940 --> 01:02:57,527
Those remarks won't get you
