716
01:02:57,777 --> 01:03:02,032
My luck's changing
for the better every day.

717
01:03:02,699 --> 01:03:06,745
All right, baby, come to Roger.

718
01:03:07,537 --> 01:03:10,582
Center mass.

719
01:03:15,211 --> 01:03:18,631
Read them and weep.

720
01:03:20,383 --> 01:03:22,844
Do you sleep with that thing?

721
