725
01:03:54,084 --> 01:03:57,837
Hey! Look at that, will you?
Not bad for an old man.

726
01:03:58,088 --> 01:04:01,800
Step aside, old man.

727
01:04:56,438 --> 01:04:59,774
Have a nice day.

728
