Okay, here it is.

757
01:07:24,627 --> 01:07:26,338
Some kids playing this morning...

758
01:07:26,588 --> 01:07:28,715
...one saw a guy checking the meter.

759
01:07:28,965 --> 01:07:31,092
- Where?
- Here at Dixie's.

760
01:07:31,343 --> 01:07:35,680
He was playing under the porch.
Says he saw the guy pretty good.

761
01:07:35,930 --> 01:07:39,351
- It could be a break.
- Those kids are 6 years old.

762
01:07:39,601 --> 01:07:42,187
- You call the gas company?
- Sure did.

763
01:07:42,437 --> 01:07:47,192
No one's supposed to check
that meter for at least a month.

764
01:07:47,442 --> 01:07:50,445
- Let me handle this.
- Be my guest.

765
01:07:50,695 --> 01:07:53,907
He's the little fellow
that saw the guy.

766
01:07:54,157 --> 01:07:57,118
My name is Detective Murtaugh.
What's yours?

767
01:07:57,369 --> 01:08:00,705
- Don't tell him your name.
- He'll put you in jail.

768
01:08:00,955 --> 01:08:02,248
You won't see your mom.

769
01:08:02,499 --> 01:08:06,294
It's all right. I won't
put you in jail. What's your name?

770
01:08:06,544 --> 01:08:09,881
- Don't tell him, Alfred.
- Alfred!

771
01:08:10,131 --> 01:08:13,468
This is Alfred! Hey, meet Alfred.
This is Alfred.

772
01:08:13,718 --> 01:08:16,471
Alfred, hi! How old are you?

773
01:08:16,721 --> 01:08:18,014
Six.

774
01:08:18,264 --> 01:08:21,851
Six years old. I bet you like Go-Bots.

775
01:08:22,102 --> 01:08:23,728
Is that a real gun?

776
01:08:23,978 --> 01:08:26,147
Yeah, this is a real gun.

777
01:08:26,398 --> 01:08:27,607
Do you kill people?

778
01:08:27,857 --> 01:08:32,153
No. If some guy is hurting someone,
I try to shoot him in the leg...

779
01:08:32,404 --> 01:08:33,738
...just to stop him.

780
01:08:33,988 --> 01:08:36,533
Mama says policemen
shoot black people.

781
01:08:36,783 --> 01:08:38,660
- Is it true?
- Yeah, is it true?

782
01:08:38,910 --> 01:08:42,247
Is that true?

783
01:08:43,331 --> 01:08:45,750
Maybe we ought to get
the kids some...

784
01:08:46,001 --> 01:08:47,377
Ice cream.

785
01:08:47,627 --> 01:08:50,213
You like ice cream?

786
01:08:55,176 --> 01:08:59,347
No, not you, Alfred.

787
01:09:02,017 --> 01:09:05,353
The man you saw,
did you get a good look at him?

788
01:09:05,603 --> 01:09:08,314
- I saw him.
- Great!

789
01:09:08,565 --> 01:09:13,153
Picture him in your head.
Close your eyes.

790
01:09:13,403 --> 01:09:15,739
Think what he looks like.

791
01:09:15,989 --> 01:09:17,323
Got it?

792
01:09:17,574 --> 01:09:20,285
Can you draw him?

793
01:09:20,535 --> 01:09:23,747
Give me some drawing paper
and crayons.

794
01:09:23,997 --> 01:09:26,291
- This is good.
- Can it, man.

795
01:09:26,541 --> 01:09:29,002
We're gonna put out
an APB on Big Bird.

796
01:09:29,252 --> 01:09:32,172
"All units. Large
yellow bird, silly voice."

797
01:09:32,422 --> 01:09:35,216
You're hilarious, Martin. It's enough.

798
01:09:35,467 --> 01:09:38,178
Tell me what he looks like.

799
01:09:38,428 --> 01:09:40,472
Was he black?

800
01:09:40,722 --> 01:09:43,308
Was he white?

801
01:09:44,768 --> 01:09:46,728
Was he tall?

802
01:09:46,978 --> 01:09:48,480
Tall like me?

803
01:09:48,730 --> 01:09:51,816
What color was his hair? Brown?

804
01:09:52,067 --> 01:09:53,818
Black?

805
01:09:54,069 --> 01:09:55,487
Blond?

806
01:09:55,737 --> 01:09:58,114
His hair was blond.

807
01:09:58,365 --> 01:10:01,743
What did he have on?
Did he have jeans on?

808
01:10:01,993 --> 01:10:03,244
It was paint.

809
01:10:03,495 --> 01:10:05,163
Pained?

810
01:10:05,413 --> 01:10:07,957
I don't know.

811
01:10:09,042 --> 01:10:10,960
Painted?

812
01:10:11,211 --> 01:10:14,631
Painted. A tattoo?

813
01:10:14,714 --> 01:10:18,843
Like Popeye?
A tattoo like Popeye? No?

814
01:10:19,094 --> 01:10:21,805
It was that.

815
01:10:22,764 --> 01:10:24,641
Like that?

816
01:10:24,891 --> 01:10:27,936
Exactly like that?

817
01:10:28,061 --> 01:10:30,313
I saw it good. This is it.

818
01:10:30,563 --> 01:10:32,148
I remember.

819
01:10:32,399 --> 01:10:33,983
Are you sure?

820
01:10:34,234 --> 01:10:37,070
It had a knife, even.

821
01:10:47,080 --> 01:10:50,667
Roger, that's a Special Forces tattoo.

822
01:10:50,917 --> 01:10:53,628
Really?

823
01:10:53,795 --> 01:10:58,800
A Special Forces tattoo,
mercury switches...

824
01:11:01,261 --> 01:11:05,390
What the hell
have we gotten into here?

825
01:11:06,766 --> 01:11:11,646
Wonder if there's an opening
in the fire department.

826
01:11:20,321 --> 01:11:21,740
Want to tell me about it?

827
01:11:21,990 --> 01:11:24,367
- About what?
- Don't bullshit me.

828
01:11:24,617 --> 01:11:28,038
Your daughter wasn't killed
for something she was into.

829
01:11:28,288 --> 01:11:32,042
She was killed
for something you're into.

830
01:11:32,250 --> 01:11:34,544
Stop me if I'm wrong.

831
01:11:34,794 --> 01:11:37,756
I don't know what you mean.

832
01:11:38,006 --> 01:11:41,343
Keep your hands
away from your pocket, okay?

833
01:11:41,593 --> 01:11:42,385
Easy, man.

834
01:11:42,635 --> 01:11:45,013
Fuck easy.

835
01:11:46,514 --> 01:11:50,393
You called me the other day
to blow the whistle, right?

836
01:11:50,643 --> 01:11:52,187
Blow the whistle on what?

837
01:11:52,437 --> 01:11:55,732
You were going to tell all,
so they killed your daughter.

838
01:11:55,982 --> 01:11:58,735
Tell me if I'm wrong.
Talk to me!

839
01:11:58,985 --> 01:12:01,196
They killed your daughter.

840
01:12:01,446 --> 01:12:04,532
They paid off a hooker to poison
your little girl.

841
01:12:04,783 --> 01:12:06,826
Chrissake!
I've got another daughter.

842
01:12:07,077 --> 01:12:10,622
- She'll be protected.
- You don't know these people.

843
01:12:10,872 --> 01:12:14,209
Acquaint me with them.

844
01:12:16,211 --> 01:12:19,464
It goes back to the war.

845
01:12:21,132 --> 01:12:26,930
I worked with a group called
"Air America". CIA front.

846
01:12:27,681 --> 01:12:30,767
They secretly ran
the entire war out of Laos.

847
01:12:31,017 --> 01:12:35,271
I was with a special unit called
"Shadow Company". Trained killers.

848
01:12:35,522 --> 01:12:39,025
When Charlie brought in heroin
to finance the VC government...

849
01:12:39,275 --> 01:12:42,278
...Shadow Company burned
the whole thing down.

850
01:12:42,529 --> 01:12:45,907
We killed everybody.

851
01:12:49,411 --> 01:12:51,329
We also formed a plan.

852
01:12:51,579 --> 01:12:54,249
Keep talking.

853
01:12:58,920 --> 01:13:02,465
A few years ago, Shadow Company
got together again.

854
01:13:02,716 --> 01:13:05,135
The war was over.

855
01:13:05,385 --> 01:13:09,014
But we still had our sources in Asia.

856
01:13:09,264 --> 01:13:11,433
We've been bringing it in
ever since.

857
01:13:11,683 --> 01:13:13,810
Bringing in what?

858
01:13:14,060 --> 01:13:15,645
Heroin.

859
01:13:15,895 --> 01:13:19,691
Two major shipments a year.

860
01:13:21,568 --> 01:13:24,487
It's all run by ex-CIA.

861
01:13:24,738 --> 01:13:27,323
Soldiers, mercs.

862
01:13:27,574 --> 01:13:29,617
You son of a bitch!

863
01:13:29,868 --> 01:13:33,747
If you had cold feet, why did
they kill Amanda? Why not you?

864
01:13:33,997 --> 01:13:36,416
- They can't. They need me.
- Why?

865
01:13:36,666 --> 01:13:43,256
My company is a perfect front. Makes
everything look great on tax reports.

866
01:13:45,425 --> 01:13:49,304
This is big business, Roger.

867
01:13:52,599 --> 01:13:55,018
Not anymore.

868
01:13:55,268 --> 01:13:57,228
I'm gonna burn it down.

869
01:13:57,479 --> 01:13:59,647
You can't. It's too big.

870
01:13:59,898 --> 01:14:03,151
These people are trained,
expert killers.

871
01:14:03,401 --> 01:14:07,489
Tell me about your next shipment:
Where it's coming in, how many...

872
01:14:07,739 --> 01:14:10,867
I can't tell you that, Roger.
I can't.

873
01:14:11,117 --> 01:14:17,290
I have another daughter. You can't
protect her. I'm in this too deep.

874
01:14:35,016 --> 01:14:40,188
Heroin.
You got off easy, you son of a bitch!

875
01:14:59,332 --> 01:15:00,625
You through?

876
01:15:00,875 --> 01:15:02,919
I haven't even started.

877
01:15:03,169 --> 01:15:07,966
{y:i}Gen. McAllister, this is Delta One.
{y:i}We're coming in. Over.

878
01:15:08,216 --> 01:15:10,635
- So your mission is accomplished?
{y:i}- Yes, sir.

879
01:15:10,885 --> 01:15:13,096
{y:i}Mr. Hunsaker is dead, sir.

880
01:15:13,346 --> 01:15:16,224
{y:i}I'm afraid, however,
{y:i}that another problem exists.

881
01:15:16,474 --> 01:15:18,059
{y:i}What is it? Explain.

882
01:15:18,309 --> 01:15:20,353
{y:i}Hunsaker spoke to the police.

883
01:15:20,603 --> 01:15:23,898
{y:i}- Are they dead?
{y:i}- No, I missed the opportunity.

884
01:15:24,149 --> 01:15:27,986
{y:i}Very disappointing. So the police
{y:i}may know the whole operation?

885
01:15:28,236 --> 01:15:30,280
{y:i}That is correct, sir.

886
01:15:30,530 --> 01:15:32,907
Joshua, it's time
we turned up the heat.

887
01:15:33,158 --> 01:15:36,119
Come on home.

888
01:15:52,886 --> 01:15:55,764
What's a nice Irish girl
like you doing out here?

889
01:15:56,014 --> 01:15:59,059
I'm looking for a guy,
had this girl in his stable.

890
01:15:59,309 --> 01:16:02,437
- Never seen her.
- She's in your line of work. You sure?

891
01:16:02,687 --> 01:16:05,148
- Sure. Why?
- I'm a police officer.

892
01:16:05,398 --> 01:16:09,611
Don't worry, I won't drag your
ass to jail...

893
01:16:35,595 --> 01:16:37,806
You wore your vest!

894
01:16:38,056 --> 01:16:41,935
That was smart, kid. Come on.

895
01:16:42,602 --> 01:16:46,481
Hold on! I'm on your side.

896
01:16:47,607 --> 01:16:50,443
Son of a bitch, that hurts!

897
01:16:50,694 --> 01:16:54,698
I'm pissed, Roger! Now I'm pissed.

898
01:16:54,989 --> 01:16:56,491
Look at your face!

899
01:16:56,741 --> 01:16:58,827
Two inches higher,
he'd have hit your head.

900
01:16:59,077 --> 01:17:01,621
Two inches lower,
I'd be a falsetto for life.

901
01:17:01,871 --> 01:17:05,333
I bet you'd sound nice too.

902
01:17:05,542 --> 01:17:09,087
- Where's my gun?
- Here.

903
01:17:10,630 --> 01:17:12,924
Oh, shit! Roger!

904
01:17:13,174 --> 01:17:15,635
The guy who shot me...

905
01:17:15,885 --> 01:17:19,305
The same albino jackrabbit
son of a bitch that did Hunsaker.

906
01:17:19,556 --> 01:17:20,557
You sure?

907
01:17:20,807 --> 01:17:23,393
I'm sure, man.
I never forget an asshole.

908
01:17:23,643 --> 01:17:25,812
I got an idea.

909
01:17:26,062 --> 01:17:29,649
We fly first class to Detroit
and lay low for a couple weeks.

910
01:17:29,899 --> 01:17:32,235
Come on, be serious.
What do we do?

911
01:17:32,485 --> 01:17:33,611
What else?

912
01:17:33,862 --> 01:17:36,489
We bury the fuckers.
And you know what else?

913
01:17:36,740 --> 01:17:41,411
We do this right, we get famous.
Do shaving ads. Girls. Money.

914
01:17:41,661 --> 01:17:44,289
With our luck, we'll do
Forest Lawn commercials.

915
01:17:44,539 --> 01:17:47,667
Bullshit! We got the edge.

916
01:17:47,917 --> 01:17:53,089
Roger, they think I'm dead.
I'm a corpse.

917
01:17:57,802 --> 01:18:00,764
Brilliant.

918
01:18:01,264 --> 01:18:04,559
Brilliant shit!

919
01:18:05,977 --> 01:18:07,687
{y:i}We got a body for you.

920
01:18:07,937 --> 01:18:11,441
He was at Hunsaker's place.
I saw him, he saw me.

921
01:18:11,691 --> 01:18:13,777
Get someone else to do it, okay?

922
01:18:14,027 --> 01:18:18,406
{y:i}Captain says give it to you.
{y:i}About two blocks from your house.

923
01:18:18,656 --> 01:18:22,452
Yeah, sure. He's probably blond
with big dimples.

924
01:18:22,702 --> 01:18:26,581
{y:i}How did you know that, sarge?

925
01:18:26,915 --> 01:18:29,084
Get in here!

926
01:18:29,334 --> 01:18:31,920
Trouble.

927
01:18:33,713 --> 01:18:39,135
They just gave a description
of the kid my daughter's dating.

928
01:19:05,078 --> 01:19:08,790
Let's be dark and quiet.

929
01:19:48,580 --> 01:19:52,334
The bastards got my daughter.

930
01:20:02,260 --> 01:20:03,720
What is it?

931
01:20:03,970 --> 01:20:04,763
Nothing.

932
01:20:05,013 --> 01:20:06,556
- What is it?!
- Nothing!

933
01:20:06,806 --> 01:20:11,102
Get back in your room.
Back in your room!

934
01:20:26,868 --> 01:20:28,787
{y:i}You have a beautiful daughter.

935
01:20:29,037 --> 01:20:34,042
{y:i}I'd stick by the phone to find out
{y:i}where to meet us.

936
01:20:38,505 --> 01:20:41,800
They got my kid.

937
01:20:42,008 --> 01:20:45,637
Bastards took my baby.

938
01:21:07,575 --> 01:21:10,787
{y:i}Sgt. McCaskey, pick up line three.

939
01:21:11,037 --> 01:21:12,747
Homicide, McCaskey speaking.

940
01:21:12,997 --> 01:21:14,290
This is KCOP news.

941
01:21:14,541 --> 01:21:18,920
We heard an officer was shot tonight.
Can you give us more information?

942
01:21:19,170 --> 01:21:22,882
Sgt. Martin Riggs was shot and killed.
Who is this?

943
01:21:23,133 --> 01:21:26,636
We'll send somebody right over.

944
01:21:29,597 --> 01:21:32,308
Bingo! Riggs is out of the picture.

945
01:21:32,559 --> 01:21:34,602
I want Murtaugh taken alive.

946
01:21:34,853 --> 01:21:37,313
He may not talk.

947
01:21:37,564 --> 01:21:41,026
We have his little girl.
He'll talk.

948
01:21:55,582 --> 01:21:59,961
You know they're gonna kill her,
don't you?

949
01:22:01,713 --> 01:22:06,217
And if you want her back,
you'll have to take her away from them.

950
01:22:06,468 --> 01:22:09,304
I know.

951
01:22:13,183 --> 01:22:17,354
We do this my way.
You shoot and you shoot to kill.

952
01:22:17,604 --> 01:22:22,025
Get as many as you can.
All you got to do is just not miss.

953
01:22:22,275 --> 01:22:25,362
I won't miss.

954
01:22:25,820 --> 01:22:30,283
We're going to get bloody on this one.

955
01:22:32,911 --> 01:22:36,164
Are you really crazy?

956
01:22:37,374 --> 01:22:41,211
Or are you as good
as you say you are?

957
01:22:41,795 --> 01:22:45,215
You're gonna have to trust me.

958
01:22:47,676 --> 01:22:50,553
Here we go.

959
01:22:55,725 --> 01:22:59,938
{y:i}We don't want your daughter.
{y:i}We want to know what Hunsaker told you.

960
01:23:00,188 --> 01:23:05,777
{y:i}Dry Lake. Victorville.
{y:i}Sunrise tomorrow. Be there.

961
01:26:09,252 --> 01:26:10,962
Murtaugh!

962
01:26:11,212 --> 01:26:12,630
Yes, that's right.

963
01:26:12,881 --> 01:26:14,924
Show me my daughter!

964
01:26:15,175 --> 01:26:19,554
Let me see her,
then I'll come quietly.

965
01:26:24,976 --> 01:26:26,603
He wants to see the girl.

966
01:26:26,853 --> 01:26:29,647
Get out.

967
01:26:33,610 --> 01:26:35,111
Daddy!

968
01:26:35,362 --> 01:26:37,947
Okay, baby! I'm here.

969
01:26:38,198 --> 01:26:40,116
Okay, it's all right.

970
01:26:40,367 --> 01:26:42,118
Simple exchange.

971
01:26:42,369 --> 01:26:45,955
You come with us,
the girl takes a walk.

972
01:26:46,206 --> 01:26:49,209
Let her go now.

973
01:26:49,918 --> 01:26:53,463
As I say, take your hands
out of your pockets.

974
01:26:53,713 --> 01:26:56,925
Sure thing, pal.

975
01:26:59,219 --> 01:27:01,763
It's alive.

976
01:27:02,722 --> 01:27:05,934
Let her go now, or we all die.

977
01:27:06,184 --> 01:27:07,352
Take him!

978
01:27:07,602 --> 01:27:08,853
He has a grenade!

979
01:27:09,104 --> 01:27:12,607
He's bluffing!
He wouldn't risk killing his daughter.

980
01:27:12,857 --> 01:27:14,401
If she's gonna die...

981
01:27:14,651 --> 01:27:19,614
...she's gonna die with me.
My way, not yours.

982
01:27:23,243 --> 01:27:27,622
Come on, Roger, get out of the way.
Move to your left. Come on!

983
01:27:27,872 --> 01:27:29,582
Put the pin back in.

984
01:27:29,833 --> 01:27:33,753
Officer Murtaugh, don't be foolish.
Look at the hardware.

985
01:27:34,004 --> 01:27:37,173
Move to your left.

986
01:27:41,302 --> 01:27:44,931
Look at the firepower.
You're grounded. Riggs is gone.

987
01:27:45,181 --> 01:27:47,308
Put the pin back in the grenade.

988
01:27:47,559 --> 01:27:49,394
If you come closer...

989
01:27:49,644 --> 01:27:50,979
...then we all die.

990
01:27:51,229 --> 01:27:55,692
No! I don't think so.

991
01:28:02,157 --> 01:28:05,493
Come on, honey.

992
01:28:06,036 --> 01:28:07,037
Just a smoker.

993
01:28:07,287 --> 01:28:09,664
Bingo.

994
01:28:13,668 --> 01:28:14,502
Where is he?

995
01:28:14,753 --> 01:28:17,130
It's Riggs.

996
01:28:18,006 --> 01:28:21,885
Rianne, get in the car!

997
01:28:22,010 --> 01:28:25,263
Get in the fucking car!

998
01:28:41,696 --> 01:28:43,281
Go, Rianne, go!

999
01:28:43,531 --> 01:28:47,494
Come on, cottontail,
stick your head up.

1000
01:28:47,744 --> 01:28:51,790
That's it, you son of a bitch.
Good night.

1001
01:28:53,917 --> 01:28:58,171
Don't try it, son.
You're not that fast.

1002
01:28:58,630 --> 01:29:00,423
{y:i}Hello, Joshua. Hello, Joshua.

1003
01:29:00,674 --> 01:29:02,967
- Yes, sir.
{y:i}- I got Riggs.

1004
01:29:03,218 --> 01:29:07,472
He's got Riggs. Go get the girl!

1005
01:29:41,339 --> 01:29:43,341
Throw your weapon down!

1006
01:29:43,591 --> 01:29:47,470
Put your hands behind your head!

1007
01:29:50,015 --> 01:29:53,852
You're Gen. Peter McAllister,
commander of Shadow Company.

1008
01:29:54,102 --> 01:29:56,730
I see we've heard of each other.

1009
01:29:56,980 --> 01:30:01,192
Yep. It'll almost be a shame
when I nail you.

1010
01:30:01,443 --> 01:30:05,822
I ran into some of those Shadow Company
pussies in Saigon in '69.

1011
01:30:06,072 --> 01:30:08,908
You did, did you?

1012
01:30:54,496 --> 01:30:57,874
Leave me alone!

1013
01:31:23,066 --> 01:31:25,527
Save your strength.
You'll need it.

1014
01:31:25,777 --> 01:31:27,696
Who's the Chin?

1015
01:31:27,946 --> 01:31:31,408
Endo, meet Mr. Martin Riggs.

1016
01:31:31,658 --> 01:31:34,577
Endo has forgotten more
about dispensing pain...

1017
01:31:34,828 --> 01:31:37,622
...than we'll ever know.

1018
01:31:37,956 --> 01:31:39,666
See, we have a problem.

1019
01:31:39,916 --> 01:31:42,002
Since we have Murtaugh...

1020
01:31:42,252 --> 01:31:43,628
...we don't need you.

1021
01:31:43,878 --> 01:31:48,800
- I believe in being thorough.
- I've heard that about you.

1022
01:31:49,467 --> 01:31:52,637
Our problem, and yours too...

1023
01:31:52,887 --> 01:31:55,849
...is we have a shipment
of merchandise to deliver.

1024
01:31:56,099 --> 01:31:59,519
Why don't you just call it heroin?

1025
01:31:59,644 --> 01:32:02,731
It's rather large, this shipment.

1026
01:32:02,981 --> 01:32:04,858
It would be unfortunate...

1027
01:32:05,108 --> 01:32:08,278
...if we showed up
to deliver our heroin...

1028
01:32:08,528 --> 01:32:10,238
...and were surrounded by 50 cops.

1029
01:32:10,488 --> 01:32:11,698
That would be too bad.

1030
01:32:11,948 --> 01:32:14,200
Yes, it would be.

1031
01:32:14,451 --> 01:32:17,328
So we have to find out
all the cops know.

1032
01:32:17,579 --> 01:32:22,083
We don't know shit.
You did Hunsaker before he could say...

1033
01:32:22,917 --> 01:32:28,006
I wish I could believe you.
Unfortunately, I don't.

1034
01:32:31,593 --> 01:32:34,471
Now, if you tell me
everything you know...

1035
01:32:34,721 --> 01:32:38,558
...I promise you I'll kill you quick.

1036
01:32:39,184 --> 01:32:42,479
I told you everything I know.

1037
01:32:48,109 --> 01:32:51,196
What is that thing?

1038
01:32:51,571 --> 01:32:53,656
I'll tell you.

1039
01:32:53,907 --> 01:32:57,494
It's electric shock treatment.

1040
01:32:57,952 --> 01:33:02,582
We're in for a long night,
because I don't know shit.

1041
01:33:03,375 --> 01:33:06,294
We'll see.

1042
01:33:13,510 --> 01:33:15,970
Hit him again!

1043
01:33:24,562 --> 01:33:26,940
Again!

1044
01:33:30,819 --> 01:33:33,905
Tell me about the shipment!

1045
01:33:34,781 --> 01:33:37,325
I'm gonna fucking kill both of you!

1046
01:33:37,575 --> 01:33:41,496
Very funny.
What about the shipment?

1047
01:33:45,625 --> 01:33:47,919
The shipment, Mr. Murtaugh.

1048
01:33:48,169 --> 01:33:51,089
Go spit!

1049
01:33:51,339 --> 01:33:53,800
Salt.

1050
01:34:07,772 --> 01:34:12,193
Go spit, you son of a bitch.
Fuck you!

1051
01:34:12,444 --> 01:34:14,029
This is getting nowhere.

1052
01:34:14,279 --> 01:34:16,990
Mr. Large.

1053
01:34:22,704 --> 01:34:23,997
He knows shit. We're safe.

1054
01:34:24,247 --> 01:34:27,584
He'd have told us.
Nobody can take that.

1055
01:34:27,834 --> 01:34:29,127
Fine.

1056
01:34:29,377 --> 01:34:32,339
Badass soldier, huh?

1057
01:34:45,435 --> 01:34:48,146
Get her up.

1058
01:34:51,733 --> 01:34:54,361
Untie me and I'll kill
all of you bastards!

1059
01:34:54,611 --> 01:34:56,321
Tell me what you know.

1060
01:34:56,571 --> 01:35:00,825
Fuck you, bastard!
I'll kill you!

1061
01:35:06,748 --> 01:35:10,085
Sorry, pal.
Say good night.

1062
01:35:30,397 --> 01:35:33,608
That's a real good-looking
young woman...

1063
01:35:33,858 --> 01:35:37,779
...you got there, Mr. Murtaugh.

1064
01:35:39,155 --> 01:35:40,323
I've told you everything.

1065
01:35:40,573 --> 01:35:42,033
We'll soon know, won't we?

1066
01:35:42,283 --> 01:35:44,077
I'm warning you.

1067
01:35:44,327 --> 01:35:45,370
Don't.

1068
01:35:45,620 --> 01:35:48,081
Spare me, son. It's over.

1069
01:35:48,331 --> 01:35:52,335
There's no more heroes
left in the world.

1070
01:35:56,256 --> 01:35:59,050
Kill that son of a bitch!

1071
01:36:08,977 --> 01:36:10,645
That asshole's getting away!

1072
01:36:10,895 --> 01:36:13,106
Who's fucking next?

1073
01:36:13,356 --> 01:36:14,899
McAllister!

1074
01:36:15,150 --> 01:36:17,861
Who's next?

1075
01:36:19,404 --> 01:36:20,989
Pretty thin, huh?

1076
01:36:21,239 --> 01:36:24,242
Anorexic.

1077
01:36:30,206 --> 01:36:32,459
- Let's do what the shepherd did.
- What?

1078
01:36:32,709 --> 01:36:36,046
Get the flock out of here.

1079
01:36:46,431 --> 01:36:47,891
Is it him?

1080
01:36:48,141 --> 01:36:51,811
No. It's not Joshua.

1081
01:38:07,178 --> 01:38:08,972
Halt! Stop! Stop!

1082
01:38:09,222 --> 01:38:13,518
Get out of the fucking car!
Come on, now!

1083
01:38:14,811 --> 01:38:17,439
Police officers!

1084
01:38:32,454 --> 01:38:38,918
I'm a police officer. Give me
some backup and take care of the girl.

1085
01:39:07,447 --> 01:39:09,282
He's going for the freeway!

1086
01:39:09,532 --> 01:39:11,910
You okay?

1087
01:39:14,871 --> 01:39:20,418
Cut over the 3rd Street bridge!
You'll get ahead of him.

1088
01:39:22,003 --> 01:39:25,382
General McAllister...

1089
01:39:25,507 --> 01:39:29,094
...time for you to die.

1090
01:40:15,974 --> 01:40:18,685
Hold it!

1091
01:40:39,873 --> 01:40:43,168
Get back in your car!

1092
01:41:03,730 --> 01:41:07,400
Mind if I test drive your Audi?

1093
01:41:09,486 --> 01:41:13,239
Stop the son of a bitch!

1094
01:41:16,785 --> 01:41:19,245
Shit!

1095
01:41:19,829 --> 01:41:22,707
He got my car!

1096
01:41:24,000 --> 01:41:27,629
- Get back!
- Hey, man, I'm cool.

1097
01:41:37,222 --> 01:41:40,392
Let's get out of here!

1098
01:41:42,977 --> 01:41:45,522
Open the door!

1099
01:41:54,072 --> 01:41:57,909
Kill that cop son of a bitch!

1100
01:41:58,785 --> 01:42:02,747
No way you live. No way.

1101
01:43:27,290 --> 01:43:29,459
- Gangway!
- Hold it now.

1102
01:43:29,709 --> 01:43:33,380
- Police officer.
- Go ahead.

1103
01:43:37,300 --> 01:43:40,470
Well, shit!
What now, kid?

1104
01:43:40,720 --> 01:43:43,640
First thing, we get you to a hospital.

1105
01:43:43,890 --> 01:43:46,184
Come on. Let's go.

1106
01:43:46,434 --> 01:43:49,229
Don't breathe this stuff.
You'll see pink elephants.

1107
01:43:49,479 --> 01:43:51,439
The slippery son of a bitch got away!

1108
01:43:51,690 --> 01:43:55,902
- What do you mean he got away?
- Hey, fire me.

1109
01:43:57,529 --> 01:43:58,780
Where you going?

1110
01:43:59,030 --> 01:44:00,907
Sarge, I'm commandeering your car.

1111
01:44:01,157 --> 01:44:02,409
What's the matter?

1112
01:44:02,659 --> 01:44:05,203
My home!
The bastard knows where I live.

1113
01:44:05,453 --> 01:44:08,123
I'll drive, Cochise.

1114
01:44:08,373 --> 01:44:12,585
- I gotta look at him!
- He's all right.

1115
01:44:14,421 --> 01:44:17,173
3-W-30 en route to
Sgt. Murtaugh's residence.

1116
01:44:17,424 --> 01:44:21,261
Requesting additional units.

1117
01:44:53,501 --> 01:44:55,587
Excuse me, sir.
May we help you?

1118
01:44:55,837 --> 01:44:58,381
No, thank you.

1119
01:45:24,199 --> 01:45:27,035
{y:i}Good morning, sir.

1120
01:45:27,285 --> 01:45:30,580
{y:i}Tell me, what day is it?

1121
01:45:30,830 --> 01:45:34,042
Goddamn Christmas!

1122
01:45:34,042 --> 01:45:38,046
I'll give you a home
to come back to.

1123
01:45:54,604 --> 01:45:58,358
Crazy son of a bitch!

1124
01:46:16,376 --> 01:46:19,546
Give me that. Drop it.

1125
01:46:27,721 --> 01:46:30,432
Looking for the general?

1126
01:46:30,682 --> 01:46:36,062
He's barbecuing his nuts
on Hollywood Boulevard.

1127
01:46:42,277 --> 01:46:44,863
What do you say, Jack?

1128
01:46:45,113 --> 01:46:47,615
Like a shot at the title?

1129
01:46:47,866 --> 01:46:51,077
Don't mind if I do.

1130
01:47:06,217 --> 01:47:11,181
Okay, men! I'm Sgt. Murtaugh.
My responsibility here!

1131
01:47:11,431 --> 01:47:13,099
{y:i}Watch commander is en route.

1132
01:47:13,350 --> 01:47:18,355
{y:i}Until then, Sgt. Murtaugh
{y:i}is in charge on-site.

1133
01:47:20,982 --> 01:47:24,611
Just keep the citizens clear.

1134
01:47:35,038 --> 01:47:38,333
Keep everyone back!

1135
01:47:45,048 --> 01:47:47,967
It's Sgt. Riggs' arrest.
I take full responsibility!

1136
01:47:48,218 --> 01:47:52,138
The son of a bitch
killed two of our men!

1137
01:47:56,518 --> 01:47:59,562
Get him, kid!
He's yours!

1138
01:48:12,951 --> 01:48:16,246
Come on, Riggs! Come on!

1139
01:48:23,253 --> 01:48:27,507
You want to quit now?
You want to quit?

1140
01:48:35,515 --> 01:48:39,060
Give me your nightstick!

1141
01:48:47,527 --> 01:48:49,154
Come on!

1142
01:48:49,404 --> 01:48:52,365
Show me what you got!

1143
01:48:57,746 --> 01:49:00,790
Eat this, sucker!

1144
01:49:24,939 --> 01:49:26,775
Let them take him!

1145
01:49:27,025 --> 01:49:30,070
Let me take him!

1146
01:49:30,695 --> 01:49:33,823
No! Back off!

1147
01:50:11,069 --> 01:50:13,988
Break his fucking neck!

1148
01:50:20,662 --> 01:50:23,039
It's not worth it.

1149
01:50:27,627 --> 01:50:30,505
You lose.

1150
01:50:37,595 --> 01:50:41,307
Get that shit off my lawn!

1151
01:50:44,894 --> 01:50:47,814
How you doing, kid?

1152
01:51:11,880 --> 01:51:13,423
I got you.

1153
01:51:13,673 --> 01:51:16,676
I got you, partner.

1154
01:51:52,003 --> 01:51:55,715
Merry Christmas, Victoria Lynn.

1155
01:51:55,924 --> 01:51:58,760
I love you.

1156
01:52:22,367 --> 01:52:23,952
How are you?

1157
01:52:24,202 --> 01:52:26,663
I'm going to be all right. You?

1158
01:52:26,913 --> 01:52:29,749
I'm good.

1159
01:52:31,376 --> 01:52:33,336
Give this to your dad, okay?

1160
01:52:33,586 --> 01:52:37,298
It's a present for him.
Tell him I won't need it anymore.

1161
01:52:37,549 --> 01:52:41,136
- It's a bullet.
- Yeah, it's a bullet.

1162
01:52:41,386 --> 01:52:44,472
He'll understand.

1163
01:52:44,639 --> 01:52:48,268
You want to come in?
We're building.

1164
01:52:48,685 --> 01:52:52,188
No, I gotta go.

1165
01:52:52,981 --> 01:52:55,358
You have a nice Christmas, though.

1166
01:52:55,608 --> 01:52:57,736
Okay. You too.

1167
01:52:57,986 --> 01:52:58,987
Okay. Bye.

1168
01:52:59,237 --> 01:53:01,948
Bye.

1169
01:53:15,420 --> 01:53:17,464
After all we've been through...

1170
01:53:17,714 --> 01:53:21,926
...if you think I'm gonna eat
the world's worst turkey by myself...

1171
01:53:22,177 --> 01:53:24,179
...you're crazy.

1172
01:53:24,429 --> 01:53:27,265
- I'll tell you a little secret.
- What?

1173
01:53:27,515 --> 01:53:30,393
I'm not crazy.

1174
01:53:31,478 --> 01:53:33,063
I know.

1175
01:53:33,313 --> 01:53:35,982
Oh, good. Let's eat.

1176
01:53:36,024 --> 01:53:37,525
Hey, you know something?

1177
01:53:37,776 --> 01:53:39,736
I think your daughter likes me.

1178
01:53:39,986 --> 01:53:42,364
- If you touch her, I'll kill you.
- You'll try.

1179
01:53:42,614 --> 01:53:47,410
- You mind if I bring a friend?
- Of course, bring a friend.

1180
01:53:54,292 --> 01:53:56,503
I don't think the cat
will like this.

1181
01:53:56,753 --> 01:54:00,340
I'll put five on the mutt.

1182
01:54:07,722 --> 01:54:11,476
I'm too old for this.
